msgid "**A `svc-ai-lmstudio` role is added as a routable backend, x86/GPU node only.** It deploys LM Studio in headless server mode (`lms server`, OpenAI-compatible API) and registers behind the gateway. LM Studio has no arm64 Linux server build, so it MUST be pinned to an x86 (typically GPU) node via placement constraint and MUST NOT be scheduled onto the Raspberry Pi / arm64 agent nodes of [032](032-agent-employees-firecracker.md). LM Studio ships primarily as a desktop GUI; the role MUST use its headless/server mode, and the README MUST document the container caveat (GPU passthrough, licensing/model-download constraints)."
msgstr ""

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**A blocked mode is NEVER a reason to silently switch to another.** If a mode cannot run (the swarm NFS wedge below, a wedged daemon, a missing host capability), STOP the whole sweep, report the blocker together with the exact recovery command, and wait for it to be cleared. You MUST NOT fall back to a `modes=compose`-only (or any reduced) sweep to look productive: it hides the unmet swarm parity and never satisfies the compose-AND-swarm gate. Resume the full sweep only once the blocker is gone."
msgstr "**Moda yang diblokir TIDAK PERNAH alasan untuk diam-diam beralih ke yang lain.** Jika sebuah mode tidak dapat dijalankan (Keramaian NFS di bawah ini, daemon yang terjepit, kemampuan inang yang hilang), Hentikan seluruh penyapuan, laporkan pemblokirnya bersama-sama dengan perintah pemulihan yang tepat, dan tunggu untuk itu dibersihkan. Anda JANGAN JANGAN jatuh kembali ke `modes=compose`-only (morfine atau apapun dikurangi) menyapu terlihat produktif: itu menyembunyikan paritas kawanan unmet dan tidak pernah memuaskan gerbang compose-AND-swarm. Melanjutkan penyapuan penuh hanya setelah pemblokiran hilang."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**A change in `services.hugo.source_version`** invalidates the clone, which invalidates `COPY ./services/repository/` in the Dockerfile, which triggers a fresh `hugo` build on the next deploy."
msgstr "**Perubahan dalam `services.hugo.source_version`** Tidak sahkan klon, yang tidak valid `COPY ./services/repository/` Di Dockerfile, yang memicu segar `hugo` Membangun pada penyebaran berikutnya."

# translation-refused: libretranslate protected-span
