# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Deploy iteration.** [deploy/cli.py](../../../cli/administration/deploy/development/deploy/cli.py) re-derives the same plan via `plan_dev_inventory_matrix` (the planner is a pure function shared between init and deploy) and runs one deploy per folder. **Every round deploys its full variant-aware include set.** Round R starts from a clean host (the previous round's include is purged before round R begins, see point 5), so every dep that round R needs MUST be redeployed."
msgstr "**Meledakkan iterasi.** [deploy/cli.py](../../../cli/administration/deploy/development/deploy/cli.py) Re-derives rencana yang sama melalui `plan_dev_inventory_matrix` (Para perencana adalah fungsi murni yang dibagi antara init dan penyebaran) Dan menjalankan satu penyebaran per folder. **Setiap putaran mengerahkan seluruh varian-aware termasuk set.** Ronde R dimulai dari host bersih (Termasuk babak sebelumnya adalah dibersihkan sebelum putaran R dimulai, lihat titik 5)Jadi setiap dep yang putaran R perlu dideploy ulang."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Deploy on an Encrypted Server** You SHOULD install Infinito.Nexus on an encrypted server to prevent hosting providers from accessing end-user data. For a practical guide on setting up an encrypted server, refer to the [Hetzner Arch LUKS repository](https://github.com/kevinveenbirkenbach/hetzner-arch-luks) 🔐. (Learn more about [disk encryption](https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Disk_encryption) on Wikipedia.)"
msgstr "**Menguraikan pada Server Terenkripsi** Kau harus pasang Infinito.Nexus Cofold pada server terenkripsi untuk mencegah penyedia hosting dari mengakses data end-user. Untuk panduan praktis pada pengaturan server terenkripsi, mengacu pada [Repositori Hetzner Arch LUKS](https://github.com/kevinveenbirkenbach/hetzner-arch-luks) 🔐. (Belajarlah lebih banyak tentang [Enkripsi cakram](https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Disk_encryption) Wikipedia.)"

