msgid "**Embodied / dedicated-device mode moves the trust boundary to the whole device.** For an agent that owns and explores a single-purpose machine (a robot platform, a home-assistant appliance), the isolation boundary is the entire dedicated node, not a guest kernel inside it. Privileged/full host access (`/dev`, GPIO, sensors, cameras, host network) is allowed **only** on a node that is dedicated, single-tenant, network-segmented, and explicitly opted in, with the blast radius documented in the role README. It is **forbidden on any shared cluster node**: agents on shared infrastructure always stay under Decision #4. This is the deliberate exception that keeps the general rule intact rather than a hole in it."
msgstr "**Mode Embodied / device-device berdedikasi menggerakkan batas kepercayaan ke seluruh perangkat.** Untuk agen yang memiliki dan menjelajahi mesin tunggal (Sebuah robot platform, peralatan rumah tangga), batas isolasi adalah seluruh node khusus, bukan kernel tamu di dalamnya. Keprioritasan/akses host penuh (`/dev`, GPIO, sensor, kamera, jaringan host) Tidak boleh **Hanya** Pada node yang didedikasikan, tunggal-tenant, jaringan-segmented, dan secara eksplisit opted dalam, dengan radius ledakan didokumentasikan dalam peran README. Ini adalah **Dilarang pada setiap nodus kelompok bersama**Agen di infrastruktur bersama selalu berada di bawah Keputusan #4. Ini pengecualian disengaja yang membuat aturan umum tetap utuh daripada lubang di dalamnya."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Enable Two-Factor Authentication (2FA)** You MUST enable 2FA whenever possible. Many password managers (like KeePassXC) can generate [TOTP](https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Time-based_One-Time_Password) tokens, adding an extra layer of security even if your password is compromised. Synchronize your password database across devices using the [Nextcloud Client](https://nextcloud.com/) 📱💻."
msgstr "**Hidupkan Otentikasi Dwi-Aktifkan (2FA)** Anda harus mengaktifkan 2FA bila memungkinkan. Banyak manajer sandi (Seperti KeePassXC) Koderma dapat menghasilkan [TOTP](https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Time-based_One-Time_Password) token, menambahkan lapisan ekstra keamanan bahkan jika password Anda dikompromikan. Synchronize database password Anda di seluruh perangkat menggunakan [Nextcloud Klien](https://nextcloud.com/) 📱💻."

