# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Enable state defaults to off; deliberately-wired integrations auto-enable with their partner.** `enabled` is optional and defaults to `false` unless `required: true` is set. An addon that bridges a service MUST derive its effective enablement from that service's `enabled` flag (never a duplicated group-membership expression), so a deliberately-wired cross-role integration activates automatically whenever its partner role is co-deployed (`services.<target>.enabled` is true) and stays off otherwise. Any credential an addon needs is declared in `meta/secrets.yml` `credentials:` and read via `lookup('config', application_id, 'secrets.credentials.<name>')` (Decision 4): auto-generated where possible, or supplied through the same credentials mechanism's manual-entry path where the operator must enter the secret. There is no separate opt-in exception: auto-enable-with-partner holds, and an operator-entered credential resolves through `credentials` like any other. This auto-enable-with-partner rule is distinct from update-automation-discovered addons (Decision 10), which are added hard-off."
msgstr "**Memungkinkan default negara untuk dimatikan; integrasi kabel- sengaja dapat otomatis dengan pasangan mereka.** `enabled` ORANG adalah pilihan dan baku untuk `false` kecuali jika kecuali `required: true` Sudah siap. Adonan yang menjembatani layanan MUST mendapatkan mengaktifkan efektif dari layanan itu `enabled` Bendera (Jangan pernah meniru ekspresi kelompok-anggota), jadi integrasi lintas-role kabel sengaja diaktifkan secara otomatis setiap kali peran mitranya disatukan (`services.<target>.enabled` Tidak benar) Dan tetap menjauh. Setiap bukti kelayakan kebutuhan addon dinyatakan dalam `meta/secrets.yml` `credentials:` Dan baca via `lookup('config', application_id, 'secrets.credentials.<name>')` (Keputusan 4)Dihasilkan secara otomatis di mana mungkin, atau diberikan melalui jalur akses manual mekanisme kelayakan yang sama di mana operator harus memasuki rahasia. Tidak ada pengecualian opt-in terpisah: auto-enable-with-partner memegang, dan sebuah operator-entered credential penyelesaian melalui `credentials` Seperti yang lainnya. Aturan auto-enable-with-partner ini berbeda dari addons yang ditemukan oleh update-automasi (Keputusan 10), yang ditambahkan hard-off."

