# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Inventory folders.** [init.py](../../../cli/administration/deploy/development/init.py) calls [build_dev_inventory_matrix](../../../cli/administration/deploy/development/inventory/builder.py), which creates one folder per round at `<inventory-dir>-<round>` (or just `<inventory-dir>` when there is a single round). For each folder, `build_dev_inventory` resolves the round's per-app variant payload and bakes it into the inventory's `host_vars` as `applications.<app>: <variant-payload>` overrides. The inventory is therefore variant-resolved on disk; no runtime selector is needed."
msgstr "**folder inventaris.** [init.py](../../../cli/administration/deploy/development/init.py) Panggilan [build_dev_inventory_matrix](../../../cli/administration/deploy/development/inventory/builder.py), Yang menciptakan satu folder per bundar pada `<inventory-dir>-<round>` (Atau hanya `<inventory-dir>` Bila ada satu putaran)Untuk setiap folder, `build_dev_inventory` Melepaskan muatan varian per-app putaran dan memanggangnya ke dalam inventaris `host_vars` sebagai `applications.<app>: <variant-payload>` Pembatalan. Oleh karena itu, inventori tersebut adalah variant-resolved di disk; tidak ada pemilih waktu jalan diperlukan."

