# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Token handling was unified:** Mailu and Matomo now read tokens from users.*.tokens (mailu_token legacy removed), and a token-store hydration mechanism loads persisted tokens automatically."
msgstr "**Penanganan Token tanpa rantai:** Dan Matomo Sekarang, kami membaca token dari pengguna.*.tokens (mailu_token warisan dihapus), Dan mekanisme hidrasi token-store memuat token berkelanjutan secara otomatis."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Token protected:** every request carries a token from the credential store; the token is never handed to a browser user."
msgstr "**Token dilindungi:** Setiap permintaan membawa token dari toko kredensial; token tidak pernah diserahkan kepada pengguna peramban."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Token publishing:** Manager-fetched worker/manager join tokens are published as facts to every cluster member."
