msgid "A services.<key> flag (``enabled`` / ``shared``) MAY be true if it is the literal Python ``True``, any string containing the substring ``in group_names``, or a string referencing a `GROUP_GATED_CONSTANTS` entry. Negated and compound predicates (``\"{{ 'X' not in group_names }}\"``) match on purpose: they are true on some node shape, and the static closure is the co-deploy superset. Mirrors the substring test at ``tests/integration/roles/meta/services/test_dynamic_flags.py:194``."
msgstr "Layanan A.<key> Bendera (``enabled`` / / / // ``shared``) MUNGKIN benar jika itu adalah Python literal ``True``, setiap string yang mengandung substring ``in group_names``, atau string referensi a `GROUP_GATED_CONSTANTS` Entri. Dipisahkan dan predikat senyawa (``\"{{ 'X' not in group_names }}\"``) Kecocokan sengaja: mereka benar pada beberapa bentuk node, dan penutupan statis adalah superset co-deploy. Cerminkan tes substring di ``tests/integration/roles/meta/services/test_dynamic_flags.py:194``."

