# translated-by: libretranslate
#, python-brace-format
msgid "Cross-service probes (biber denied at prometheus, biber denied at matomo, dashboard tile reachability) are NOT part of the per-role biber persona. They live in the provider's own spec (`web-app-{prometheus,matomo,dashboard}/files/playwright/playwright.spec.js`), parameterised once over the provider's `<NAME>_TARGET_ROLES_JSON` manifest. For the dashboard, the parameterised scenario delegates to `web-app-dashboard/files/playwright/dashboard-card-flow.js::runDashboardCardScenario(page, context, target)`, which owns the tile visibility / iframe-embed / \"Tab\" pop-out assertions in one SPOT."
msgstr "Probe layanan silang (Biber orakel ditolak di prometeus, biber ditolak di matomo, kebolehcapaian tile dashboard) TIDAK merupakan bagian dari persona biber per-role. Mereka tinggal dalam spesifikasi provider sendiri (`web-app-{prometheus,matomo,dashboard}/files/playwright/playwright.spec.js`), di parameterkan sekali atas penyedia `<NAME>_TARGET_ROLES_JSON` Bukti. Untuk dashboard, di parameterkan skenario delegasi untuk `web-app-dashboard/files/playwright/dashboard-card-flow.js::runDashboardCardScenario(page, context, target)`, yang memiliki visibilitas ubin / iframe-embed / \"Tab\" Pernyataan pop-out dalam satu SPOT."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "Cross-service probes are NOT part of the per-role administrator persona. Dashboard tile reachability is owned by `web-app-dashboard/files/playwright/playwright.spec.js`, which delegates the per-target body to the `runDashboardCardScenario` helper in `dashboard-card-flow.js` (tile visible → click loads in `#main iframe` → header \"Tab\" button pops the embed into a fresh browser tab). That helper is the SPOT for dashboard-tile mechanics; consumer specs MUST NOT reimplement any of those assertions. Prometheus admin-reach and scrape parity are owned by `web-app-prometheus/files/playwright/playwright.spec.js`. Matomo admin-reach and tracker presence are owned by `web-app-matomo/files/playwright/playwright.spec.js`. Each provider parameterises the assertion over its `<NAME>_TARGET_ROLES_JSON` manifest."
msgstr "Probe lintas-layanan bukanlah bagian dari persona administrator per-role. Kebolehcapaian ubin papan Dashboard dimiliki oleh `web-app-dashboard/files/playwright/playwright.spec.js`, yang delegasi tubuh per-target ke `runDashboardCardScenario` penolong dalam `dashboard-card-flow.js` (jubin tampak → klik beban masuk `#main iframe` → header \"Tab\" Tombol flight menekan embed ke tab peramban segar). Pembantu itu adalah SPOT untuk mekanika dashboard-tile; spesifikasi konsumen TIDAK reimplement salah satu dari mereka pernyataan. Prometheus admin-reach dan mengikis paritas dimiliki oleh `web-app-prometheus/files/playwright/playwright.spec.js`. Matomo admin-reach dan kehadiran pelacak dimiliki oleh `web-app-matomo/files/playwright/playwright.spec.js`. Setiap penyedia parameterkan pernyataan di atasnya `<NAME>_TARGET_ROLES_JSON` Bukti."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "Cross-service surface assertions (dashboard tile reachability, prometheus admin-reach and scrape parity, matomo admin-reach and tracker presence, biber-denied-at-prometheus, biber-denied-at-matomo) are owned by the provider's own spec. Each provider parameterises the assertion over its `<NAME>_TARGET_ROLES_JSON` manifest, rendered via `lookup('roles_with_service', '<svc>')`. Consumer roles' personas MUST NOT duplicate these probes."
msgstr "Pernyataan permukaan jasa silang (Kebolehcapaian tile papan dashboard, prometeeus admin-reach dan mengikis parity, matomo admin-reach dan kehadiran pelacak, biber-denied-at-prometheus, biber-denied-at-matomo) Hak siar dimiliki oleh spesifikasi provider sendiri. Setiap penyedia provider parameterkan pernyataan atas itu `<NAME>_TARGET_ROLES_JSON` manifest, dirender melalui `lookup('roles_with_service', '<svc>')`. Peran konsumer 'personas HARUS TIDAK duplikasi probe ini."

