msgid "Documents a `services.matomo.track: false` opt-out in `roles/<role>/meta/services.yml`. The role keeps `services.matomo.{enabled,shared}: true` (so the role-wiring contract stays satisfied) but `roles_with_service('matomo')` drops it from `MATOMO_TARGET_ROLES_JSON` and the matomo tracker e2e contract. Reserved for static-file (autoindex) and 301-redirect vhosts that carry no user-facing HTML page worth a `_paq` tracker. The marker accompanies the `track:` data flag the lookup honors."
msgstr "Dokumen-dokumen Dokumen a `services.matomo.track: false` opt-out di `roles/<role>/meta/services.yml`. Peran terus `services.matomo.{enabled,shared}: true` (Jadi kontrak perputaran peran tetap puas) tapi `roles_with_service('matomo')` Dari... `MATOMO_TARGET_ROLES_JSON` Dan pelacak matomo e2Kontrak khusus. Rizab Simpanan untuk berkas statis (Otoindex) Dan 301-redirect vhosts yang tidak membawa halaman HTML facing pengguna bernilai `_paq` Pelacak. Perandaan marker `track:` Data bendera pencarian kehormatan."

# translated-by: libretranslate
#, python-brace-format
msgid "Documents a `services.prometheus.scrape: false` opt-out in `roles/<role>/meta/services.yml`. The role keeps `services.prometheus.{enabled,shared}: true` (so the role-wiring contract stays satisfied) but `roles_with_service('prometheus')` drops it from `PROMETHEUS_TARGET_ROLES_JSON`. Reserved for 301-redirect-only vhosts that never serve a request through lua-resty-prometheus, so they emit no `app=\"<role>\"` label and have no scrape target. The marker accompanies the `scrape:` data flag the lookup honors."
msgstr "Dokumen-dokumen Dokumen a `services.prometheus.scrape: false` opt-out di `roles/<role>/meta/services.yml`. Peran terus `services.prometheus.{enabled,shared}: true` (Jadi kontrak perputaran peran tetap puas) tapi `roles_with_service('prometheus')` Dari... `PROMETHEUS_TARGET_ROLES_JSON`. Disimpan untuk 301-redirect-only vhosts yang tidak pernah melayani permintaan melalui lua-resty-prometheus, sehingga mereka memancarkan tidak `app=\"<role>\"` label dan tidak memiliki target scrape. Perandaan marker `scrape:` Data bendera pencarian kehormatan."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "Documents an `unsafe-*: true` flag in `roles/*/meta/csp.yml`. MUST be paired with a `Reason:` on the same line naming what breaks without the relaxation. `unsafe-inline` re-admits the inline execution an XSS needs and `unsafe-eval` re-admits string-to-code, so the flag has to be verified against the running app, not copied from another role."
msgstr "Dokumen-dokumen `unsafe-*: true` Bendera di `roles/*/meta/csp.yml`. Harus dipasangkan dengan `Reason:` Dari garis yang sama penamaan apa yang istirahat tanpa relaksasi. `unsafe-inline` Keluarkan kembali eksekusi inline kebutuhan XSS dan `unsafe-eval` Re-admits string-to-code, sehingga bendera harus diverifikasi terhadap aplikasi berjalan, tidak disalin dari peran lain."

