# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "Fork PRs cannot publish mirror packages directly, so their runs wait for the `pull_request_target` mirror producer before continuing. The producer mirrors with the Docker Hub credentials only for trusted PRs ([🛡️ Trusted](#trusted-fork-prs-)); untrusted forks mirror anonymously (no organization secrets). See [mirror.md](../image/mirror.md) for the mirroring architecture and naming convention."
msgstr "PR Fork tidak dapat mempublikasikan paket cermin secara langsung, sehingga menjalankan mereka menunggu untuk `pull_request_target` Produser cermin cermin sebelum melanjutkan. Penerbit cermin dengan Docker Hub bukti hanya untuk PR terpercaya ([🛡️ Dipercaya](#trusted-fork-prs-)); garpu tak dipercaya cermin tanpa nama (Tak ada rahasia organisasi)Lihat [mirror.md](../image/mirror.md) Ini untuk arsitektur cermin dan konvensi penamaan."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "Fork PRs cannot publish packages themselves, so their untrusted `pull_request` runs wait in `scripts/meta/wait/mirrors.sh` until a trusted producer run has published the required refs."
msgstr "Humas Fork tidak dapat mempublikasikan paket sendiri, sehingga mereka tidak dipercaya `pull_request` Ditunggu di `scripts/meta/wait/mirrors.sh` Hingga seorang produser yang dipercaya telah menerbitkan wasit yang dibutuhkan."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "Fork PRs run under the `pull_request` event without write permissions. Privileged steps (image builds, package writes) run via `pull_request_target`. The fork CI waits for those privileged images before proceeding. See [pull-request.md](pull-request.md) for the contributor-facing fork workflow."
msgstr "Para pria Fork berlari di bawah `pull_request` Event tanpa izin menulis. Langkah - langkah yang menyimpang (build gambar, penulisan paket) Dijalankan melalui `pull_request_target`. CI garpu menunggu gambar-gambar istimewa sebelum melanjutkan. Lihat [pull-request.md](pull-request.md) - Tidak."

