# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "Fork [rpardini/docker-registry-proxy](https://github.com/rpardini/docker-registry-proxy) and teach the bundled nginx to handle GCP Artifact Registry redirect URLs (`/artifacts-downloads/namespaces/<ns>/repositories/<repo>/downloads/<token>`). Currently `gcr.io` blob pulls are bypassed via `NO_PROXY=…,gcr.io,storage.googleapis.com,googleusercontent.com` in [compose/registry-cache/proxy.conf](compose/registry-cache/proxy.conf), which is a workaround that disables caching for those registries. Long-term: rebase upstream's `proxy.conf` / `sub_filter` rules to recognise the new redirect shape, ship the fix in our fork, point `compose/registry-cache/Dockerfile` (or its image tag) at the fork, and drop the `NO_PROXY` bypass."
msgstr "Perancis [rpardini/docker-registry-proxy](https://github.com/rpardini/docker-registry-proxy) dan mengajarkan nginx yang dibundel untuk menangani GCP Artefak Registry redirect URL (`/artifacts-downloads/namespaces/<ns>/repositories/<repo>/downloads/<token>`)Sekarang `gcr.io` Tarikan blob vorbia dilewati melalui `NO_PROXY=…,gcr.io,storage.googleapis.com,googleusercontent.com` dalam [compose/registry-cache/proxy.conf](compose/registry-cache/proxy.conf), Ini adalah solusi yang mematikan caching untuk registries tersebut. Jangka panjang: basis ulang hulu `proxy.conf` / / / // `sub_filter` Aturan untuk mengenali bentuk pengalihan baru, kapal memperbaiki di garpu kami, titik `compose/registry-cache/Dockerfile` (Nama dan tag gambarnya) Di garpu, dan menjatuhkan `NO_PROXY` bypass."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "Fork `pull_request` runs always receive a read-only token (GitHub-enforced); the label never grants write tokens or secrets to the untrusted event."
msgstr "Perancis `pull_request` run run runs selalu menerima token baca-sahaja (Angkatan-GitHub); label tidak pernah memberikan tanda tulis atau rahasia untuk peristiwa yang tidak dipercaya."

