# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "Health proves the host boots, not that it holds its data. Before the backup the drill seeds one token into every subject — a `.dr-drill-marker` file at the root of each backed-up volume, a row in `infinito_dr_marker` in each database with a dump — then forces one more backup run so the generation under test carries it, and afterwards requires every one of them back. A volume silently dropped or a dump replayed empty fails here; before, both passed."
msgstr "Kesehatan membuktikan bot tuan rumah, bukan bahwa ia memegang datanya. Sebelum cadangan benih bor satu token ke setiap subjek — `.dr-drill-marker` Berkas di akar setiap volume backed-up, berturut-turut dalam `infinito_dr_marker` Di setiap basis data dengan dump — kemudian memaksa satu backup lagi berjalan sehingga generasi di bawah tes membawanya, dan setelah itu mengharuskan mereka semua kembali. Sebuah volume diam-diam dijatuhkan atau dump replayed kosong gagal di sini; sebelum, kedua lulus."

