msgstr "Uji integrasi untuk substrat pengerahan yang setiap saham peran: Templat Docker Comprotch, konsistensi gambar Docker, jaringan kontainer, registry layanan bersama, dan kontrak cadangan."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "Integration tests that enforce contracts between tasks and handlers. One file per contract, no second opinion on the same rule:"
