# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "Integration tests that enforce every `include_tasks` / `import_tasks` / `include_role` / `import_role` target referenced from role tasks (and other project YAML) resolves to an existing file."
msgstr "Integrasi tes yang menegakkan setiap `include_tasks` / / / // `import_tasks` / / / // `include_role` / / / // `import_role` Target jardon yang dirujuk dari tugas peran (YAML dan proyek lain YAML) Melepaskan ke file yang ada."

