# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "Single source of truth for the per-addon enable flags consumed by the Playwright addon-gating helper (``tests/addon-gating.js`` -> ``skipUnlessAddonEnabled``). Replaces the error-prone per-template Jinja loop: it resolves the materialised ``addons`` mapping for ``application_id`` and returns one ``<ADDON_ID>_ADDON_ENABLED=<true|false>`` line per declared addon (sorted by env key, newline-joined), where the env-key derivation matches addon-gating.js exactly."
msgstr "Sumber tunggal kebenaran untuk per-addon memungkinkan bendera yang dikonsumsi oleh pembantu Adon-pembawaan Playwright (``tests/addon-gating.js`` -> ``skipUnlessAddonEnabled``). Mengganti kesalahan-prone per-template Jinja loop: ia menyelesaikan materialisasi ``addons`` pemetaan mapping untuk ``application_id`` Dan mengembalikan satu ``<ADDON_ID>_ADDON_ENABLED=<true|false>`` baris exydiction addon (Diurut oleh kunci env, baru-digabung)Di mana derivasi env-key cocok dengan addon-gating.js Tepatnya."

