# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "Snipe-IT is entered through a trusted-header bridge: the oauth2-proxy authenticates against Keycloak and Snipe-IT's `loginViaRemoteUser()` mints a native session for the matching `users.username` row (see [`files/php/apply/sso_config.php`](./files/php/apply/sso_config.php)). The gate declares no `allowed_groups`, so `biber` passes the proxy — but the role provisions only the administrator account ([`tasks/03_admin.yml`](./tasks/03_admin.yml)), so the header carries a username Snipe-IT does not know and the visitor falls back to the native login form. [`templates/playwright.env.j2`](./templates/playwright.env.j2) therefore declares `PERSONA_BIBER_BLOCKED=true`, while the `administrator` persona stays live (`PERSONA_ADMINISTRATOR_BLOCKED=false`) and exercises the full bridge end to end."
msgstr "Snipe-IT masuk melalui jembatan yang dipercaya-header: oauth2-proksi autentifikasi terhadap -proxy Keycloak Dan Snipe-IT `loginViaRemoteUser()` Para mint sebuah sesi asli untuk pencocokan `users.username` baris (Lihat [`files/php/apply/sso_config.php`](./files/php/apply/sso_config.php))Pintu gerbang menyatakan tidak `allowed_groups`, jadi `biber` gandia melewati proksi — tetapi ketentuan peran hanya akun administrator ([`tasks/03_admin.yml`](./tasks/03_admin.yml)), jadi header membawa nama pengguna Snipe-IT tidak tahu dan pengunjung jatuh kembali ke bentuk login asli. [`templates/playwright.env.j2`](./templates/playwright.env.j2) Oleh karena itu menyatakan `PERSONA_BIBER_BLOCKED=true`, Sementara `administrator` persona tinggal hidup (`PERSONA_ADMINISTRATOR_BLOCKED=false`) Dan latihan jembatan penuh berakhir."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "Snipe-IT is entered through a trusted-header bridge: the oauth2-proxy authenticates against Keycloak and Snipe-IT’s ``loginViaRemoteUser()`` mints a native session for the matching ``users.username`` row (see ```files/php/apply/sso_config.php`` <./files/php/apply/sso_config.php>`__). The gate declares no ``allowed_groups``, so ``biber`` passes the proxy — but the role provisions only the administrator account (```tasks/03_admin.yml`` <./tasks/03_admin.yml>`__), so the header carries a username Snipe-IT does not know and the visitor falls back to the native login form. ```templates/playwright.env.j2`` <./templates/playwright.env.j2>`__ therefore declares ``PERSONA_BIBER_BLOCKED=true``, while the ``administrator`` persona stays live (``PERSONA_ADMINISTRATOR_BLOCKED=false``) and exercises the full bridge end to end."
msgstr "Snipe-IT masuk melalui jembatan yang dipercaya-header: oauth2-proksi autentifikasi terhadap -proxy Keycloak ORANG Snipe-IT ``loginViaRemoteUser()`` Para mint sebuah sesi asli untuk pencocokan ``users.username`` baris (Lihat ```files/php/apply/sso_config.php`` <./files/php/apply/sso_config.php>`__). The gate declares no ``allowed_groups``, so ``biber`` passes the proxy — but the role provisions only the administrator account (```tasks/03_admin.yml`` <./tasks/03_admin.yml>`__), so the header carries a username Snipe-IT does not know and the visitor falls back to the native login form. ```templates/playwright.env.j2`` <./templates/playwright.env.j2>`__ therefore declares ``PERSONA_BIBER_BLOCKED=true``, while the ``administrator`` persona stays live (``PERSONA_ADMINISTRATOR_BLOCKED=false``) Dan latihan jembatan penuh berakhir."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "Snipe‑IT is an open‑source asset management system designed to streamline hardware and software inventory tracking. This deployment provides an automated, containerized solution using Docker Compose, centralized MariaDB database integration, and secure, configurable environment settings, including robust SMTP email support and pending SAML authentication enhancements."
msgstr "Awarez Snipe‐IT adalah sistem manajemen aset source terbuka yang dirancang untuk streamline perangkat keras dan pelacakan inventaris perangkat lunak. Pengerahan ini menyediakan solusi terkontenisasi otomatis menggunakan Docker Compose, terpusat MariaDB Integrasi basis data, dan pengaturan lingkungan yang aman dan dapat diatur, termasuk dukungan email SMTP yang kuat dan peningkatan otentikasi SASL yang tertunda."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "So `meta/services.yml` MUST NOT have a top-level `services:` key wrapping its content. `meta/volumes.yml` MUST NOT have a top-level `volumes:` key, and the same rule applies to `meta/server.yml`, `meta/rbac.yml`, `meta/users.yml`, and `meta/info.yml`. The filename alone fixes the path prefix in the materialised application tree, which keeps consumer paths short and predictable (no redundant `compose.…` prefixes)."
msgstr "Jadi `meta/services.yml` TIDAK HARUS memiliki tingkat atas `services:` Kuncinya akan membungkus isinya. `meta/volumes.yml` TIDAK HARUS memiliki tingkat atas `volumes:` Kunci, dan aturan yang sama berlaku untuk `meta/server.yml`, `meta/rbac.yml`, `meta/users.yml`, Dan `meta/info.yml`. Nama berkas saja memperbaiki awalan jalur dalam pohon aplikasi yang menjelma, yang membuat jalur konsumen pendek dan dapat diprediksi (Jangan berlebihan `compose.…` imbuhan)."

