# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "Swarm mode    - `<stack>_<service_key>`, matching how Docker Swarm names every service and how `container service ps` accepts them. The stack name is derived from ``application_id`` via the ``get_entity_name`` filter, mirroring how ``docker stack deploy`` composes the stack name in ``sys-svc-compose/handlers/main.yml``."
msgstr "Mode panas - `<stack>_<service_key>`, cocok bagaimana Docker Swarm Nama setiap layanan dan bagaimana `container service ps` Mereka menerimanya. Nama tumpukan berasal dari ``application_id`` Melalui ``get_entity_name`` Filter, cermin bagaimana ``docker stack deploy`` Menggubah nama tumpukan dalam ``sys-svc-compose/handlers/main.yml``."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "Swarm mode    - a shell subshell that resolves the running task's container ID at exec time, e.g. `\"$(/usr/bin/resolve-container-id mattermost mattermost)\"`. Swarm names every service ``<stack>_<key>`` and accepts no prefix matching; the helper composes that name from STACK and SERVICE_KEY args. The subshell defers resolution to the moment of exec, avoiding the stale ID and parse-time-failure pitfalls of returning a resolved value at vars-resolution time."
msgstr "Mode penyangkalan - sebuah subshell shell yang menyelesaikan ID kontainer tugas yang dijalankan pada waktu exec, mis. `\"$(/usr/bin/resolve-container-id mattermost mattermost)\"`. Mengayunkan nama setiap layanan ``<stack>_<key>`` dan menerima tidak ada pencocokan awal; pembantu menggubah nama itu dari STACK dan SERVICE_KEY Afars. Subshell tunda resolusi ke saat exec, menghindari ID basi dan parse-time-failure pitfalls mengembalikan nilai yang diselesaikan pada waktu vars-resolusi."

