# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The 2.7.0 image ships 23 tool categories, which are application names (``calendar``, ``files``, ``mail``, ``talk``, …) rather than operations: each bundles its read and its write tools, and the hub offers no setting that removes only the mutating ones. Enabling the ExApp writes ``true`` for every category absent from ``tool_status``, so the hub itself serves all of them, write tools included."
msgstr "Perancis 2.7.0 Kapal-kapal gambar 23 Kategori alat, yang merupakan nama aplikasi (``calendar``, ``files``, ``mail``, ``talk``, ...) Ketimbang operasi: setiap bundel bacaan dan alat tulisnya, dan hub tidak menawarkan pengaturan yang hanya menghapus yang bermutasi. Membenarkan tulisan ExApp ``true`` Setiap kategori tidak hadir ``tool_status``, sehingga hub sendiri melayani mereka semua, alat tulis termasuk."

