msgid "The role installs the ``@openai/codex`` npm package and, when the workstation also runs ```svc-ai-litellm`` <../svc-ai-litellm/>`__, writes a provider profile that sends every completion to the gateway over the loopback address the engine publishes it on. Nothing leaves the machine: the gateway answers on ``127.0.0.1``, so the workstation’s virtual key never crosses a network."
msgstr "Peran memasang peran ``@openai/codex`` Paket npm dan, ketika workstation juga berjalan ```svc-ai-litellm`` <../svc-ai-litellm/>`__, writes a provider profile that sends every completion to the gateway over the loopback address the engine publishes it on. Nothing leaves the machine: the gateway answers on ``127.0.0.1``Oleh karena itu, kunci virtual workstation tidak pernah melintasi jaringan."

