# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The shared `biber` and `administrator` persona helpers are declared blocked in [templates/playwright.env.j2](./templates/playwright.env.j2). OpenCloud Web answers Playwright's headless Chromium user agent with a \"browser not supported\" splash unless `forceAllowOldBrowser` is seeded into `localStorage` before the first navigation, and its OIDC callback runs through OpenCloud's own `/oidc-callback` → `/web-oidc-callback` routes instead of the oauth2-proxy pattern the shared helper detects. Both personas' Keycloak round trip is covered by [files/playwright/test-sso-login.js](./files/playwright/test-sso-login.js), which does that priming in [files/playwright/_shared.js](./files/playwright/_shared.js)."
msgstr "Kebersamaan `biber` Dan `administrator` Para pembantu persona wanita dinyatakan diblokir dalam [templates/playwright.env.j2](./templates/playwright.env.j2). Web OpenCloud menjawab Playwright tanpa kepala Chromium Agen pengguna agen dengan \"Pelayar web yang tidak disokong\" kecuali jika percikan `forceAllowOldBrowser` Nidan disemai ke `localStorage` Sebelum navigasi pertama, dan panggilan OIDC berjalan melalui OpenCloudSendiri `/oidc-callback` → `/web-oidc-callback` Rute-rute bukannya oauth2-proxy pola deteksi pembantu bersama. Dua-duanya sama-sama. Keycloak Perjalanan bulat yang diselenggarakan oleh [files/playwright/test-sso-login.js](./files/playwright/test-sso-login.js), yang melakukan yang priming di [files/playwright/_shared.js](./files/playwright/_shared.js)."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The shared `biber` and `administrator` persona helpers are declared blocked in [templates/playwright.env.j2](./templates/playwright.env.j2). Pixelfed's login id is the account e-mail rather than the Keycloak username, and the artisan-bootstrapped administrator name is reserved, so pixelfed's first-time OIDC registration cannot mint it either. `biber` additionally needs his Keycloak e-mail rewritten to a resolvable domain through the Keycloak admin API before the first OIDC login, because pixelfed's `dns,spoof` validator rejects `.example` addresses. Both setups live in [files/playwright/_shared.js](./files/playwright/_shared.js) and drive the dedicated login specs in `files/playwright/`."
msgstr "Kebersamaan `biber` Dan `administrator` Para pembantu persona wanita dinyatakan diblokir dalam [templates/playwright.env.j2](./templates/playwright.env.j2). ID log masuk Pixelfed adalah email akun daripada Keycloak Nama pengguna, dan nama administrator yang di-boot artian-boot disimpan, jadi pendaftaran OIDC pertama kali pixixfed juga tidak bisa mengeluarkan mint. `biber` tambahan tambahan dibutuhkan nya Keycloak Kata-kata e-mail ditulis ulang ke domain yang dapat dipecahkan melalui Keycloak admin API Sebelum login OIDC pertama, karena pikselfed's `dns,spoof` Penafsir falactor menolak `.example` Alamat. Kedua setup tinggal di [files/playwright/_shared.js](./files/playwright/_shared.js) dan drive spesifikasi log masuk khusus dalam `files/playwright/`."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The shared `biber` and `administrator` persona helpers are declared blocked in [templates/playwright.env.j2](./templates/playwright.env.j2). The OpenTalk frontend is a public-client OIDC single-page app — the container env carries nothing but the issuer and the client id, there is no server-side session and no HTML login form — so the role drives it with its own redirect-racing helper keyed on `LOGIN_*` / `BIBER_*` instead of the `ADMIN_*` pair the shared helper expects, and the browser-side session leaves the contract's in-app logout leg without a target. Both personas' Keycloak → dashboard chain is covered by [files/playwright/test-sso-login.js](./files/playwright/test-sso-login.js)."
msgstr "Kebersamaan `biber` Dan `administrator` Para pembantu persona wanita dinyatakan diblokir dalam [templates/playwright.env.j2](./templates/playwright.env.j2). The OpenTalk frontend public-client OIDC single-page app — container env tidak membawa apa-apa kecuali penerbit dan id klien, tidak ada sesi sisi-server dan tidak ada formulir login HTML — sehingga peran mendorongnya dengan sendiri redirect-racing pembantu diketik pada `LOGIN_*` / / / // `BIBER_*` Sebaliknya dari `ADMIN_*` Pasangan pembantu bersama mengharapkan, dan sesi sisi-pelayar meninggalkan kontrak in-app logkeluar leg tanpa target. Dua-duanya sama-sama. Keycloak → → rantai dashboard ditutupi oleh [files/playwright/test-sso-login.js](./files/playwright/test-sso-login.js)."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The shared `biber` and `administrator` persona helpers are declared blocked in [templates/playwright.env.j2](./templates/playwright.env.j2). The role provisions no pretix account at all — [tasks/main.yml](./tasks/main.yml) only deploys the stack — while pretix's native auth backend authenticates a pretix `User` row that is created by the interactive first-run setup. The `pretix-oidc` backend added on top lives on pretix's `/control` login page, whereas the role's base URL serves the public ticket shop that the baseline scenarios in [files/playwright/playwright.spec.js](./files/playwright/playwright.spec.js) assert. Seeding a backend user is the path back to a runnable persona journey."
msgstr "Kebersamaan `biber` Dan `administrator` Para pembantu persona wanita dinyatakan diblokir dalam [templates/playwright.env.j2](./templates/playwright.env.j2). Tidak ada akun pretix sama sekali — [tasks/main.yml](./tasks/main.yml) Hanya designer tumpukan — sementara backend asli pretix's authentifikasi mengotentifikasi sebuah pretix `User` baris ufler yang diciptakan oleh setup lari-pertama interaktif. Perancis `pretix-oidc` Bagian belakang yang ditambahkan di atas kehidupan di pretix's `/control` Halaman log masuk, sedangkan URL dasar peran melayani toko tiket publik bahwa skenario dasar dalam [files/playwright/playwright.spec.js](./files/playwright/playwright.spec.js) Afirmasi. Membibitkan sebuah pengguna backend adalah jalan kembali ke perjalanan seseorang yang dapat dijalankan."

