# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This directory contains pure resolvers that read repository state (git history, role metadata, version tags, input environment variables) and emit resolved values either via `$GITHUB_OUTPUT` or stdout. Resolvers MUST be idempotent and MUST NOT mutate repository or registry state beyond writing to `$GITHUB_OUTPUT`. The covered concerns are diff-driven app whitelist resolution, the `🧩 Subset` label dispatch (`pr_affected_roles.sh`, which picks between the PR-body subset and the diff resolver), release-tag detection, app discovery for the deploy matrix, and change detection that gates the update pipeline."
msgstr "Direktori ini berisi resolver murni yang membaca keadaan repositori (Sejarah git, data meta peran, tag versi, variabel lingkungan masukan) Dan memancarkan nilai-nilai yang terpecahkan melalui `$GITHUB_OUTPUT` Atau stdout. PERTANYAAN RUANG YANG DIPERTAHANKAN dan JANGAN mutasi repositori atau registry state diluar dari penulisan ke `$GITHUB_OUTPUT`Kekhawatiran yang tercakup adalah diff-driven app whitelist resolusi, `🧩 Subset` Operator label (`pr_affected_roles.sh`, yang memilih antara subset PR-tubuh dan diff resolver), deteksi pelepasan-tag, penemuan aplikasi untuk matriks penyebaran, dan mengubah deteksi bahwa gerbang saluran pipa pembaruan."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This directory contains repository-specific resolvers used across workflows and shell helpers."
msgstr "Direktori ini berisi resolver khusus repositori yang digunakan di seluruh alur kerja dan pembantu shell."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This directory contains resolver scripts for detecting missing derived artifacts and release metadata."
