msgid "Walk every `roles/*/meta/services.yml` and collect ints under `<entity>.ports.<scope>.<category>` (across ALL entities and ALL roles)."
msgstr "Berjalan setiap `roles/*/meta/services.yml` Dan mengumpulkan ints di bawah `<entity>.ports.<scope>.<category>` (Di seluruh entitas dan semua peran)."

