# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "WordPress's canonical surface is the public blog front page. The OIDC round-trip fires on `/wp-login.php`, which the `daggerhart-openid-connect-generic` addon auto-redirects to Keycloak (`login_type: auto`, see [`meta/addons/daggerhart-openid-connect-generic.yml`](./meta/addons/daggerhart-openid-connect-generic.yml)); the shared personas enter at the site root and never visit that path. [`templates/playwright.env.j2`](./templates/playwright.env.j2) therefore declares `PERSONA_BIBER_BLOCKED=true` and `PERSONA_ADMINISTRATOR_BLOCKED=true`. The journeys themselves are not dropped: `test-admin-oidc-login.js` drives the admin login, logout and landing assertion, and `test-rbac-roles.js` drives the Keycloak-group-to-WordPress-role mapping over the same entry point."
msgstr "Permukaan kanonik WordPress adalah halaman depan blog publik. Api round-trip OIDC pada `/wp-login.php`, Yang mana `daggerhart-openid-connect-generic` adidon auto-arah ke Keycloak (`login_type: auto`, Lihat [`meta/addons/daggerhart-openid-connect-generic.yml`](./meta/addons/daggerhart-openid-connect-generic.yml)); persona yang dibagi masuk di akar situs dan tidak pernah mengunjungi jalur tersebut. [`templates/playwright.env.j2`](./templates/playwright.env.j2) Oleh karena itu menyatakan `PERSONA_BIBER_BLOCKED=true` Dan `PERSONA_ADMINISTRATOR_BLOCKED=true`. Perjalanan sendiri tidak dijatuhkan: `test-admin-oidc-login.js` Mengemudi admin log masuk, log keluar dan mendaratkan pernyataan, dan `test-rbac-roles.js` Dondi drive Keycloak-Berkelompok-ke-WordPressPemetaan role melalui titik masuk yang sama."

