msgid "`Home Assistant <https://www.home-assistant.io/>`__ is an open-source home automation platform that connects smart-home devices from many vendors behind a single local interface. It keeps device state, dashboards, and automation rules on the machine that runs it, and exposes them through a web interface, a REST API, and a built-in MCP server."
msgstr "`Home Assistant <https://www.home-assistant.io/>`__ Otomasi rumah sumber terbuka yang menghubungkan perangkat rumah pintar dari banyak vendor di belakang antarmuka lokal tunggal. Ini menjaga keadaan perangkat, dashboard, dan otomatisasi aturan pada mesin yang menjalankannya, dan mengekspos mereka melalui antarmuka web, REST APIDan server MCP."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "`Hugo <https://gohugo.io/>`__ is a fast, single-binary static site generator written in Go. This role builds a Hugo site from any upstream Git repository (default: `gohugoio/hugoDocs <https://github.com/gohugoio/hugoDocs>`__) at image-build time and serves the rendered HTML/CSS/JS via nginx. There is no database, no application server, and no dynamic backend at runtime."
msgstr "`Hugo <https://gohugo.io/>`__ Dia cepat, satu-binary static site generator tertulis di Go. Peran ini membangun Hugo Situs dari hulu sungai Git Tambahkan ke Projek (Baku `gohugoio/hugoDocs <https://github.com/gohugoio/hugoDocs>`__) Pada waktu membangun gambar dan melayani dirender HTML/CSS/JS via nginx. Tak ada basis data, tak ada server aplikasi, dan tak ada backend dinamis saat runtime."

