# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "`Visual Studio Code <https://code.visualstudio.com/>`__ is a powerful source code editor with a wide plugin ecosystem, supporting development workflows across many languages and platforms. See also the `Arch Wiki - Development Tools <https://wiki.archlinux.org/title/Category:Development>`__ and general `Software Engineering <https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Software_engineering>`__ on Wikipedia."
msgstr "`Visual Studio Code <https://code.visualstudio.com/>`__ code editor kode sumber yang kuat dengan ekosistem plugin yang luas, mendukung alur kerja pembangunan di banyak bahasa dan platform. Lihat juga `Arch Wiki - Development Tools <https://wiki.archlinux.org/title/Category:Development>`__ umum `Software Engineering <https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Software_engineering>`__ Wikipedia."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "`Visual Studio Code <https://github.com/microsoft/vscode>`__ in a selectable flavor: the distribution’s Code - OSS build, VSCodium, or Microsoft’s own binary."
msgstr "`Visual Studio Code <https://github.com/microsoft/vscode>`__ Dalam rasa yang bisa dipilih: distribusinya Code - Buatan OSS, VSCodium, atau biner Microsoft sendiri."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "`WordPress <https://en.wordpress.org/>`__ is a versatile and widely used `content management system (CMS) <https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Content_management_system>`__ that powers millions of websites, from blogs and portfolios to e-commerce and corporate sites. This deployment provides a containerized WordPress instance optimized for multisite operation, advanced media management, and extensive plugin support, allowing you to fully leverage the rich features of the WordPress software."
msgstr "`WordPress <https://en.wordpress.org/>`__ Kegunaan dan penggunaan yang luas `content management system (CMS) <https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Content_management_system>`__ Itu kekuatan jutaan website, dari blog dan portofolio ke e-commerce dan situs perusahaan. Pengerahan ini menyediakan kontainerisasi WordPress Contoh yang dioptimalkan untuk operasi multisite, manajemen media tingkat lanjut, dan dukungan plugin ekstensif, memungkinkan Anda untuk sepenuhnya memanfaatkan fitur kaya WordPress software."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "`Zammad <https://zammad.org/>`__ is an open-source helpdesk and ticketing system. Agents handle customer requests across email, chat, phone and web; customers can open tickets from a self-service portal."
msgstr "`Zammad <https://zammad.org/>`__ Dia adalah sumber terbuka dan sistem tiket. Agen-agen woaf menangani permintaan pelanggan di seluruh email, chat, telepon dan web; pelanggan dapat membuka tiket dari portal layanan diri."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "`Zoom <https://zoom.us/>`__ is a popular video conferencing application for online meetings, webinars, and collaboration."
msgstr "`Zoom <https://zoom.us/>`__ Dia adalah aplikasi konsultasi video yang populer untuk pertemuan online, webinar, dan kolaborasi."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "`[user@]host:/dev/...` → a device on the host, recovered over ssh then pulled; `[user@]host:/image` → the image is pulled and recovered locally (`device` / `full`)"
msgstr "`[user@]host:/dev/...` → sebuah perangkat pada host, ditemukan di atas ssh kemudian ditarik; `[user@]host:/image` → → gambar ditarik dan pulih secara lokal (`device` / / / // `full`)"

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "`_as_bool` MUST accept the usual string forms (`true|false|yes|no|1|0|on|off`), booleans, and numbers. Every boolean decision in the fallbacks MUST use it so that `SYSTEM_EMAIL_*` values coming from YAML, environment variables, or already-coerced facts all behave the same."
msgstr "`_as_bool` AYAH menerima bentuk string biasa (`true|false|yes|no|1|0|on|off`), boolean, dan angka. Setiap keputusan boolean di musim gugur harus menggunakannya sehingga `SYSTEM_EMAIL_*` Nilai-nilai yang berasal dari YAML, variabel lingkungan, atau fakta yang sudah dikoersi semuanya berperilaku sama."

