# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "`playwright.spec.js` — orchestrator: TLS baseline, project creation, image asset upload, and the `guest`/`biber`/`administrator` personas. The `biber` / `administrator` personas are declared blocked via `PERSONA_*_BLOCKED` (mirroring `web-app-taiga`): Penpot's in-app \"OpenID\" entry and SPA user-menu logout aren't driveable by the generic persona helper, so both users' real auth is exercised by the dedicated login companions above."
msgstr "`playwright.spec.js` - orkestrator: TLS baseline, pembuatan proyek, upload aset gambar, dan `guest`/ / / //`biber`/ / / //`administrator` Orang aneh. Perancis `biber` / / / // `administrator` Persona dinyatakan diblokir melalui `PERSONA_*_BLOCKED` (Cerminan cermin `web-app-taiga`): Penpot di-app \"OpenID\" Logkeluar entry dan pengguna-menu SPA tidak dapat dikendarai oleh pembantu persona generik, sehingga kedua pengguna apos; real auth dijalankan oleh rekan login terdedikasi di atas."

