msgstr "`port` dibaca `external` Dan `tls`."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "`ports.internal`, `ports.local` and `ports.public` are **always** category-keyed maps, even when the map has only one entry. Polymorphic int-or-map values are NOT supported. The category names are: `http`, `database`, `websocket`, `oauth2`, `ldap`, `ssh`, `ldaps`, `stun_turn`, `stun_turn_tls`, `federation`, plus the structured `relay` block under `public:`."
msgstr "`ports.internal`, `ports.local` Dan `ports.public` adalah **Selalu** Peta kunci kategori kategori, bahkan ketika peta hanya memiliki satu entri. Nilai int-or-map polimorfik tidak didukung. Nama kategorinya adalah: `http`, `database`, `websocket`, `oauth2`, `ldap`, `ssh`, `ldaps`, `stun_turn`, `stun_turn_tls`, `federation`, ditambah struktur `relay` blok bawah `public:`."

