msgstr "🔐 **Pengaya SSO/Autentikasi:** Sambungan OpenID, LDAP, GitHub, GitLab Dan banyak lagi."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "🔑 **LDAP direct login (Option A, default off):** [`taiga-contrib-ldap-auth-ext`](https://github.com/Monogramm/taiga-contrib-ldap-auth-ext) enables users to log into Taiga directly with their LDAP credentials via the Taiga login form. Settings are appended to `config.py` at container startup."
msgstr "🔑 **LDAP direct login (Pilihan A, standar mati)KANTOR:** [`taiga-contrib-ldap-auth-ext`](https://github.com/Monogramm/taiga-contrib-ldap-auth-ext) Memungkinkan pengguna log masuk Taiga langsung dengan surat bukti mereka melalui Taiga formulir login. Pengaturan-peraturan ditambah ke `config.py` Mekanikal di tempat penyimpanan."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "🔑 **LDAP direct login (Option A, default off):** ```taiga-contrib-ldap-auth-ext`` <https://github.com/Monogramm/taiga-contrib-ldap-auth-ext>`__ enables users to log into Taiga directly with their LDAP credentials via the Taiga login form. Settings are appended to ``config.py`` at container startup."
msgstr "🔑 **LDAP direct login (Pilihan A, standar mati)KANTOR:** ```taiga-contrib-ldap-auth-ext`` <https://github.com/Monogramm/taiga-contrib-ldap-auth-ext>`__ enables users to log into Taiga directly with their LDAP credentials via the Taiga login form. Settings are appended to ``config.py`` Mekanikal di tempat penyimpanan."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "🔑 **Let’s Encrypt Integration**"
msgstr "🔑 **Mari Kita Integrasi yang Berguna**"

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "🔑 **Let’s Encrypt Integration**   Pulls in challenge configuration and CAA-record management for automatic certificate issuance and renewal."
msgstr "🔑 **Mari Kita Integrasi yang Berguna** Pulls dalam konfigurasi tantangan dan CAA-record manajemen untuk issuance sertifikat otomatis dan pembaruan."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "🔑 **OIDC login via Keycloak (Option B, default on):** [`taiga-contrib-oidc-auth`](https://github.com/taigaio/taiga-contrib-oidc-auth) enables SSO via Keycloak → LDAP. **Note:** The OIDC plugin is not published on PyPI and requires a custom `taiga-front` image with the frontend plugin built in (CoffeeScript/Gulp). Without the custom frontend image the SSO button will not appear in the UI."
msgstr "🔑 **Login OIDC via Keycloak (Pilihan B, default pada)KANTOR:** [`taiga-contrib-oidc-auth`](https://github.com/taigaio/taiga-contrib-oidc-auth) Memungkinkan SSO via Keycloak → LDAP. **Catatan:** Plugin OIDC tidak diterbitkan pada PyPI dan membutuhkan kebiasaan `taiga-front` Gambar X dengan plugin frontend dibangun di (Asia/Gulp)Tanpa gambar frontend adat tombol SSO tidak akan muncul di UI."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "🔑 **OIDC login via Keycloak (Option B, default on):** ```taiga-contrib-oidc-auth`` <https://github.com/taigaio/taiga-contrib-oidc-auth>`__ enables SSO via Keycloak → LDAP. **Note:** The OIDC plugin is not published on PyPI and requires a custom ``taiga-front`` image with the frontend plugin built in (CoffeeScript/Gulp). Without the custom frontend image the SSO button will not appear in the UI."
msgstr "🔑 **Login OIDC via Keycloak (Pilihan B, default pada)KANTOR:** ```taiga-contrib-oidc-auth`` <https://github.com/taigaio/taiga-contrib-oidc-auth>`__ enables SSO via Keycloak → LDAP. **Note:** The OIDC plugin is not published on PyPI and requires a custom ``taiga-front`` Gambar X dengan plugin frontend dibangun di (Asia/Gulp)Tanpa gambar frontend adat tombol SSO tidak akan muncul di UI."

